{"strongs": "H4217", "word": "מִזְרָח", "translit": "miz.rach", "root": "זקן", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "place of sunrise, east", "definition": "מִזְרָח noun [masculine] place of sunrise, east — absolute ׳ מ Josh 11:3 + 21 t.; construct מִזְרַח Num 21:10 + 19 t., with ה locative מִזְרָ֫חָה Exod 27:13 + 28 t., construct מִזְרְחָה Deut 4:41 ; Josh 12:1 ; Judg 21:19 (not in Genesis Leviticus Samuel Ezekiel etc.); — 1. sunrise always of quarter of the heavens = east (ה)שׁמשׁ ׳ מ Num 21:11 ( P ), Deut 4:41 ; Deut 4:47 ; Josh 1:15 ; Josh 12:1 ; Josh 13:5 (all D ), Josh 19:12 ; Josh 19:27 ; Josh 19:34 (all P ), Judg 20:43 ; Judg 21:19 ; 2Kgs 10:33 ; Isa 41:25 ; Isa 45:6 ; Isa 59:19 , compare שׁמשׁ לארץ ׳ מ Judg 11:18 שׁמשׁ וְעַדמְֿבוֺאוֺ ׳ מִמִּז Ps 50:1 ; Ps 113:3 ; Mal 1:11 more often 2. without שֶׁמֶשׁ : \\ \\ a. the east ׳ כִּרְחֹק מ מִמַּעֲרָב֑ Ps 103:12 . \\ \\ b. ׳ מִמּ from the east Isa 41:2 ; Isa 43:5 (opposed to מִמַּעֲרָב ), Isa 46:11 ; Dan 11:44 (+ מִצַּפוֺן ); ׳ מִמּ וּמִמַּעֲרָב֑ מִצָּפוֺן וּמִיָּם Ps 107:3 . \\ \\ c. to or toward the place of sunrise, to the east, eastward: (1) מִוְרָ֫חָה Num 32:19 ( P ), Deut 3:17 ; Deut 3:27 ( ׳ יָ֫מָּה וְצָפ֫וֺנָה וְתֵימָ֫נָה וּמ ), Deut 4:49 ; Josh 11:8 ; Josh 16:1 ( J E ), Josh 12:1 ; Josh 12:3 (twice in verse); Josh 13:8 (all D ), v Josh 13:27 v Josh 13:32 ; Josh 16:5 ; Josh 18:7 ; Josh 20:8 (all P ), 1Chr 9:18 ; 1Chr 26:14 || קֵ֫דְמָה Num 3:38 ; Josh 19:13 (both P ) Jer 31:40 || צָפ֫וֺנָה , יָ֫מָּה , נֶ֫גְבָּה 1Kgs 7:25 , compare Josh 16:6 ( P ) 1Chr 26:17 + קֵ֫דְמָה Exod 27:13 ; Exod 38:13 ; Num 2:3 ; Num 34:15 (all P ); מִקֶּדֶם Zech 14:4 (opposed to יָ֫מָּה ); (2) מִזְ רָךְ (without ה locative), יָ֫מָּה צָפ֫וֺנָה וָנֶ֫גְבָּה ׳ מ 1Chr 9:24 , compare Neh 12:37 לַמִּזְבֵּחַ ׳ מ 2Chr 5:12 (3) ׳ לַמִּז 1Chr 5:9 ; 1Chr 7:28 (opposed to לַמַּעֲרָב ) 1Chr 12:16 (so Baer ; v. 1Chr 12:15 van d. H ; opposed to id. ), 1Chr 26:17 (+ לַצָּפ֫וֺנָה , לַנֶּ֫גְבָּה ), Neh 3:26 לַמִּזְרָ֫חָה 2Chr 31:14 (4) ׳ אֶלהַֿמּ Dan 8:9 (+ אֶלהַֿנֶּגֶב , אֶלהַֿצֶּבִ֑י ); (5) מִיָּם עָדיָֿם וּמִצָּפוֺן עַדמִֿזְ רָךְ Amos 8:12 . \\ \\ d. (on) the east side of, construct קְצֵה מִזְרַה יְרִיחוֺ Josh 4:19 ( P ); also with לְמִזְרַח הַנָּ֑יְא לְ 1Chr 4:39 , הַיַּרְדֵּן ׳ לְמ 1Chr 6:63 with מִן , ׳ מִמִּז Josh 11:3 (opposed to מִיָּם ) compare Josh 17:10 (+ מצָּפוֺן ; both J E ), also Josh 16:6 ( P ). \\ \\ e. after a construct לגלעד ׳ עַלכָּֿלפְּֿנֵי מ 1Chr 5:10 ׳ רְחוֺב הַמּ 2Chr 29:4 ׳ שַׁעַר הַמּ Neh 3:29 ׳ אֶרֶץ מ Zech 8:7 (opposed to ארץ מְבוֺא הַשֶּׁמֶשׁ ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2459')\">BDB2459</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4217')\">H4217</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2458')\">BDB2458</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2460')\">BDB2460</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מִזְרָח</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>place of sunrise, east</highlightword> — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 11:3\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(6,11,3)\">Josh 11:3</ref> + 21 t.; construct <bdbheb>מִזְרַח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 21:10\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(4,21,10)\">Num 21:10</ref> + 19 t., with <bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> locative <bdbheb>מִזְרָ֫חָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 27:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,13)\">Exod 27:13</ref> + 28 t., construct <bdbheb>מִזְרְחָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 4:41\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,41)\">Deut 4:41</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 12:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,12,1)\">Josh 12:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 21:19\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(7,21,19)\">Judg 21:19</ref> (not in Genesis Leviticus Samuel Ezekiel etc.); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>sunrise</highlight> always of quarter of the heavens = <highlight>east</highlight> <bdbheb>(ה)שׁמשׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 21:11\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(4,21,11)\">Num 21:11</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 4:41\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,41)\">Deut 4:41</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 4:47\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"47\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"47\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,47)\">Deut 4:47</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 1:15\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(6,1,15)\">Josh 1:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 12:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,12,1)\">Josh 12:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 13:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,13,5)\">Josh 13:5</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Josh 19:12\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,12)\">Josh 19:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 19:27\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,27)\">Josh 19:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 19:34\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,34)\">Josh 19:34</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Judg 20:43\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,43)\">Judg 20:43</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 21:19\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(7,21,19)\">Judg 21:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:33\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,33)\">2Kgs 10:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 41:25\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,25)\">Isa 41:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 45:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,6)\">Isa 45:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 59:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"59\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"59\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,59,19)\">Isa 59:19</ref>, compare <bdbheb>שׁמשׁ לארץ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 11:18\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(7,11,18)\">Judg 11:18</ref> <bdbheb>שׁמשׁ וְעַדמְֿבוֺאוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִמִּז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 50:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,1)\">Ps 50:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 113:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"113\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"113\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,113,3)\">Ps 113:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mal 1:11\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(39,1,11)\">Mal 1:11</ref> more often </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> without <bdbheb>שֶׁמֶשׁ</bdbheb>: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> the east <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כִּרְחֹק מ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>מִמַּעֲרָב֑</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 103:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"103\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"103\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,103,12)\">Ps 103:12</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִמּ</bdbheb> <highlight>from the east</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 41:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,2)\">Isa 41:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 43:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,5)\">Isa 43:5</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>מִמַּעֲרָב</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Isa 46:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,46,11)\">Isa 46:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 11:44\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(27,11,44)\">Dan 11:44</ref> (+ <bdbheb>מִצַּפוֺן</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִמּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>וּמִמַּעֲרָב֑ מִצָּפוֺן וּמִיָּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 107:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"107\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"107\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,107,3)\">Ps 107:3</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <highlight>to</highlight> or <highlight>toward the place of sunrise, to the east, eastward:</highlight> (1) <bdbheb>מִוְרָ֫חָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 32:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,32,19)\">Num 32:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 3:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,17)\">Deut 3:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 3:27\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,27)\">Deut 3:27</ref> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יָ֫מָּה וְצָפ֫וֺנָה וְתֵימָ֫נָה וּמ</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Deut 4:49\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,49)\">Deut 4:49</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 11:8\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(6,11,8)\">Josh 11:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 16:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,16,1)\">Josh 16:1</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Josh 12:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,12,1)\">Josh 12:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 12:3\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(6,12,3)\">Josh 12:3</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Josh 13:8\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(6,13,8)\">Josh 13:8</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>), v<ref ref=\"Josh 13:27\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(6,13,27)\">Josh 13:27</ref> v<ref ref=\"Josh 13:32\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(6,13,32)\">Josh 13:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 16:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,16,5)\">Josh 16:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 18:7\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(6,18,7)\">Josh 18:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 20:8\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(6,20,8)\">Josh 20:8</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:18\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,18)\">1Chr 9:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 26:14\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(13,26,14)\">1Chr 26:14</ref> || <bdbheb>קֵ֫דְמָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 3:38\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,38)\">Num 3:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 19:13\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,13)\">Josh 19:13</ref> (both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Jer 31:40\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,40)\">Jer 31:40</ref> || <bdbheb>צָפ֫וֺנָה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יָ֫מָּה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>נֶ֫גְבָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:25\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,25)\">1Kgs 7:25</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Josh 16:6\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(6,16,6)\">Josh 16:6</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"1Chr 26:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,26,17)\">1Chr 26:17</ref> + <bdbheb>קֵ֫דְמָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 27:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,13)\">Exod 27:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 38:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,13)\">Exod 38:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 2:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,2,3)\">Num 2:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 34:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,34,15)\">Num 34:15</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>מִקֶּדֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 14:4\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(38,14,4)\">Zech 14:4</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>יָ֫מָּה</bdbheb>); (2) <bdbheb>מִזְ רָךְ</bdbheb> (without <bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> locative), <bdbheb>יָ֫מָּה צָפ֫וֺנָה וָנֶ֫גְבָּה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:24\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,24)\">1Chr 9:24</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Neh 12:37\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,37)\">Neh 12:37</ref> <bdbheb>לַמִּזְבֵּחַ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 5:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,5,12)\">2Chr 5:12</ref> (3) <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לַמִּז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 5:9\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,9)\">1Chr 5:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 7:28\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(13,7,28)\">1Chr 7:28</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>לַמַּעֲרָב</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:16\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,16)\">1Chr 12:16</ref> (so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Baer')\">Baer</lookup>; v.<ref ref=\"1Chr 12:15\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,15)\">1Chr 12:15</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('van d.H.')\">van d. H</lookup>; opposed to <highlight>id.</highlight>), <ref ref=\"1Chr 26:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,26,17)\">1Chr 26:17</ref> (+ <bdbheb>לַצָּפ֫וֺנָה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>לַנֶּ֫גְבָּה</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Neh 3:26\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,26)\">Neh 3:26</ref> <bdbheb>לַמִּזְרָ֫חָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:14\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,14)\">2Chr 31:14</ref> (4) <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֶלהַֿמּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 8:9\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,9)\">Dan 8:9</ref> (+ <bdbheb>אֶלהַֿנֶּגֶב</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>אֶלהַֿצֶּבִ֑י</bdbheb>); (5) <bdbheb>מִיָּם עָדיָֿם וּמִצָּפוֺן עַדמִֿזְ רָךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 8:12\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(30,8,12)\">Amos 8:12</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> (on) <highlight>the east side</highlight> of, construct <bdbheb>קְצֵה מִזְרַה יְרִיחוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 4:19\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(6,4,19)\">Josh 4:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); also with <bdbheb>לְמִזְרַח הַנָּ֑יְא לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 4:39\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(13,4,39)\">1Chr 4:39</ref>, <bdbheb>הַיַּרְדֵּן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְמ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:63\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"63\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"63\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,63)\">1Chr 6:63</ref> with <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִמִּז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 11:3\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(6,11,3)\">Josh 11:3</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>מִיָּם</bdbheb>) compare <ref ref=\"Josh 17:10\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(6,17,10)\">Josh 17:10</ref> (+ <bdbheb>מצָּפוֺן</bdbheb>; both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), also <ref ref=\"Josh 16:6\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(6,16,6)\">Josh 16:6</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P